cxx-rust-cssparser:
cxx-rust-cssparser: cxx-rust-cssparser is a C++ library for parsing CSS that uses the Rust
cxx-rust-cssparser: cssparser crate internally. The goal of this library is not
cxx-rust-cssparser: necessarily to implement a full-fledged web-compatible CSS parser.
cxx-rust-cssparser: Instead, it intends to give enough building blocks to be able to
cxx-rust-cssparser: implement such a parser, but also allows you to deviate from the
cxx-rust-cssparser: specification if needed.
